WEBVTT

00:17:27.126 --> 00:17:31.136
Moderni način življenja
nas vodi v te bolezni,

00:17:31.136 --> 00:17:33.370
medtem ko nas tradicionalni način

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.877
pred njimi ščiti.

00:17:35.877 --> 00:17:38.036
To je le nekaj primerov, 
kako se lahko učimo

00:17:38.036 --> 00:17:40.324
od tradicionalnih družb.

00:17:40.324 --> 00:17:42.211
Upam, da boste o tradicionalnih družbah

00:17:42.211 --> 00:17:44.620
brali s takim zanimanjem,

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.323
kot sem jaz živel med njimi.

00:17:47.323 --> 00:17:49.503
Hvala.

00:17:49.503 --> 00:17:53.950
(Aplavz)